<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="description" content="BTD — Breaking Through Digital. Universo transmídia de Lucian Lourenço.">
<title>BTD — Breaking Through Digital</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Rajdhani:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;1,300;1,400&family=Space+Mono:wght@400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
:root{
  --bg:#03030a;
  --bg2:#07070f;
  --bg3:#0c0c18;
  --ink:#eeeaf8;
  --ink2:#9b97b8;
  --ink3:#5a5878;
  --cyan:#00d4ff;
  --pink:#ff2d8a;
  --purple:#9b4dff;
  --blue:#2d6aff;
  --green:#00ff88;
  --red:#ff3030;
  --gold:#ffd166;
  --sans:'Rajdhani',sans-serif;
  --serif:'Cormorant Garamond',Georgia,serif;
  --mono:'Space Mono',monospace;
}
body{background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--sans);font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;overflow-x:hidden}
body::before{content:'';position:fixed;inset:0;background:repeating-linear-gradient(0deg,transparent,transparent 3px,rgba(0,212,255,0.008) 3px,rgba(0,212,255,0.008) 4px);pointer-events:none;z-index:998}

/* NAV */
nav{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:200;padding:1.2rem 4rem;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;background:rgba(3,3,10,0.88);backdrop-filter:blur(16px);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(155,77,255,0.12)}
.nav-logo{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.25em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--cyan);text-decoration:none}
.nav-links{display:flex;gap:2.5rem}
.nav-links a{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;color:var(--ink3);text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0.15em;text-transform:uppercase;transition:color 0.2s}
.nav-links a:hover{color:var(--cyan)}
.nav-toggle{display:none;background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;padding:4px}
.nav-toggle span{display:block;width:22px;height:1px;background:var(--cyan)}

/* HERO */
.hero{min-height:100vh;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;padding:8rem 4rem 5rem;position:relative;overflow:hidden;text-align:center}
.hero-bg{position:absolute;inset:0;background:
  radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 60% at 50% 0%,rgba(155,77,255,0.15) 0%,transparent 60%),
  radial-gradient(ellipse 40% 40% at 0% 100%,rgba(0,212,255,0.08) 0%,transparent 50%),
  radial-gradient(ellipse 40% 40% at 100% 100%,rgba(255,45,138,0.08) 0%,transparent 50%);
  pointer-events:none}
.hero-grid{position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(155,77,255,0.04) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(155,77,255,0.04) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:80px 80px;pointer-events:none}
.hero-inner{max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;position:relative;z-index:1}
.hero-logo{width:150px;height:150px;object-fit:contain;margin:0 auto 2.5rem;display:block;filter:drop-shadow(0 0 40px rgba(155,77,255,0.7)) drop-shadow(0 0 80px rgba(0,212,255,0.3))}
.hero-eyebrow{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;color:var(--purple);letter-spacing:0.3em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:1.5rem;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:1rem}
.hero-eyebrow::before,.hero-eyebrow::after{content:'';display:block;width:40px;height:1px;background:var(--purple)}
.hero-title{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:300;font-size:clamp(3rem,9vw,8rem);line-height:0.92;color:var(--ink);letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin-bottom:1rem}
.hero-title em{font-style:italic;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--cyan) 0%,var(--purple) 50%,var(--pink) 100%);-webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;background-clip:text}
.hero-sub{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;color:var(--ink3);letter-spacing:0.25em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:2rem}
.hero-desc{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.3rem;font-weight:300;color:var(--ink2);max-width:680px;margin:0 auto 3rem;line-height:1.9}
.hero-frentes{display:flex;gap:1.5rem;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:3rem}
.frente-tag{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:9px;letter-spacing:0.15em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:0.5rem 1.2rem;border:1px solid}
.frente-tag.mus{color:var(--pink);border-color:rgba(255,45,138,0.3)}
.frente-tag.lit{color:var(--gold);border-color:rgba(255,209,102,0.3)}
.frente-tag.av{color:var(--cyan);border-color:rgba(0,212,255,0.3)}
.frente-tag.pes{color:var(--green);border-color:rgba(0,255,136,0.3)}
.frente-tag.hq{color:var(--purple);border-color:rgba(155,77,255,0.3)}
.hero-ctas{display:flex;gap:1rem;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:2.5rem}
.btn{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:0.15em;text-transform:uppercase;text-decoration:none;padding:1rem 2.5rem;border:1px solid;transition:all 0.3s;display:inline-block;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.btn::before{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;transform:translateX(-100%);transition:transform 0.3s}
.btn:hover::before{transform:translateX(0)}
.btn-cyan{color:var(--cyan);border-color:var(--cyan)}.btn-cyan::before{background:var(--cyan)}.btn-cyan:hover{color:var(--bg)}
.btn-pink{color:var(--pink);border-color:var(--pink)}.btn-pink::before{background:var(--pink)}.btn-pink:hover{color:var(--ink)}
.btn-gold{color:var(--gold);border-color:var(--gold)}.btn-gold::before{background:var(--gold)}.btn-gold:hover{color:var(--bg)}
.hero-pi{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:9px;color:var(--ink3);letter-spacing:0.15em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:0.5rem 1.2rem;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);display:inline-block}

/* SECTIONS */
section{padding:7rem 4rem}
.s-eyebrow{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:1rem;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}
.s-eyebrow::before{content:'//';color:var(--pink)}
h2{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:300;font-size:clamp(2.5rem,5vw,4rem);line-height:1;letter-spacing:-0.01em;margin-bottom:0.5rem}
.divider{height:1px;margin:1rem 0 3rem;opacity:0.25}

/* UNIVERSO — EIXOS */
.eixos-bg{background:var(--bg2)}
.eixos-intro{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:300;color:var(--ink2);max-width:720px;line-height:1.9;margin-bottom:4rem;border-left:3px solid var(--purple);padding-left:2rem}
.eixos-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:1px;background:rgba(155,77,255,0.12);margin-bottom:4rem}
.eixo{background:var(--bg2);padding:2.5rem 1.8rem;transition:background 0.3s;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.eixo::before{content:'';position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;height:3px;transform:scaleX(0);transform-origin:left;transition:transform 0.4s}
.eixo:hover{background:var(--bg3)}
.eixo:hover::before{transform:scaleX(1)}
.eixo.mus::before{background:var(--pink)}
.eixo.lit::before{background:var(--gold)}
.eixo.av::before{background:var(--cyan)}
.eixo.pes::before{background:var(--green)}
.eixo.hq::before{background:var(--purple)}
.eixo-icon{font-size:1.5rem;margin-bottom:1rem}
.eixo-titulo{font-family:var(--sans);font-size:1rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.05em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:0.8rem}
.eixo.mus .eixo-titulo{color:var(--pink)}
.eixo.lit .eixo-titulo{color:var(--gold)}
.eixo.av .eixo-titulo{color:var(--cyan)}
.eixo.pes .eixo-titulo{color:var(--green)}
.eixo.hq .eixo-titulo{color:var(--purple)}
.eixo-desc{font-size:0.88rem;color:var(--ink2);line-height:1.75}

/* PROJETOS AUDIOVISUAIS */
.av-bg{background:var(--bg)}
.av-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1px;background:rgba(0,212,255,0.1)}
.av-card{background:var(--bg);padding:3rem 2.5rem;position:relative;overflow:hidden;transition:background 0.3s}
.av-card:hover{background:var(--bg2)}
.av-card::before{content:'';position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;height:3px;transform:scaleX(0);transform-origin:left;transition:transform 0.4s}
.av-card.btd::before{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--cyan),var(--blue))}
.av-card.tec::before{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--red),var(--pink))}
.av-card.zeus::before{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--gold),var(--purple))}
.av-card:hover::before{transform:scaleX(1)}
.av-num{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:9px;color:var(--ink3);letter-spacing:0.15em;margin-bottom:1.5rem}
.av-titulo{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:2rem;line-height:1.1;margin-bottom:0.4rem}
.av-titulo.cyan{color:var(--cyan)}
.av-titulo.red{color:var(--red)}
.av-titulo.gold{color:var(--gold)}
.av-formato{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:9px;color:var(--ink3);letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:1.2rem}
.av-desc{font-size:0.95rem;color:var(--ink2);line-height:1.85;margin-bottom:1.5rem}
.av-tags{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:0.5rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem}
.av-tag{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:8px;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:3px 10px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);color:var(--ink3)}
.av-link{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:9px;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;border-bottom:1px solid;transition:all 0.2s}
.av-link.cyan{color:var(--cyan);border-color:rgba(0,212,255,0.3)}
.av-link.red{color:var(--red);border-color:rgba(255,48,48,0.3)}

/* TRILHA */
.trilha-bg{background:var(--bg2)}
.trilha-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:4rem;align-items:start}
.trilha-info{}
.trilha-desc{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:300;color:var(--ink2);line-height:1.9;margin-bottom:2rem}
.trilha-musicas{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.5rem;margin-bottom:2rem}
.musica-link{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;color:var(--pink);text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,45,138,0.2);padding-bottom:0.3rem;transition:all 0.2s;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
.musica-link::before{content:'▶';font-size:8px}
.musica-link:hover{color:var(--cyan);border-color:rgba(0,212,255,0.3)}
.trilha-player{border:1px solid rgba(255,45,138,0.2);position:relative}
.trilha-player iframe{display:block;width:100%;height:220px;border:0}

/* LITERATURA */
.lit-bg{background:var(--bg)}
.lit-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:1.5rem}
.lit-card{border:1px solid rgba(255,209,102,0.1);padding:2.5rem;position:relative;overflow:hidden;transition:border-color 0.3s}
.lit-card:hover{border-color:rgba(255,209,102,0.3)}
.lit-card::after{content:'';position:absolute;bottom:0;left:0;right:0;height:1px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--gold),transparent);transform:scaleX(0);transform-origin:left;transition:transform 0.4s}
.lit-card:hover::after{transform:scaleX(1)}
.lit-tipo{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:9px;color:var(--gold);letter-spacing:0.15em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:0.8rem}
.lit-titulo{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.6rem;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:0.5rem;line-height:1.2}
.lit-desc{font-size:0.92rem;color:var(--ink2);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1rem}
.lit-status{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:9px;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase}
.s-ok{color:var(--green)}.s-prelo{color:var(--gold)}.s-ativo{color:var(--cyan)}
.lit-link{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:9px;color:var(--gold);text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,209,102,0.3)}

/* PERSONAGENS BTD */
.chars-bg{background:var(--bg2)}
.chars-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1.5rem}
.char-card{border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);padding:2.5rem 2rem;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.char-card::after{content:'';position:absolute;bottom:0;left:0;right:0;height:2px;transform:scaleX(0);transform-origin:left;transition:transform 0.4s}
.char-card:hover::after{transform:scaleX(1)}
.char-gabriel::after{background:var(--blue)}
.char-helena::after{background:var(--green)}
.char-romualdo::after{background:var(--red)}
.char-nome{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:2.2rem;font-weight:300;margin-bottom:0.3rem}
.char-nome.blue{color:var(--blue)}
.char-nome.green{color:var(--green)}
.char-nome.red{color:var(--red)}
.char-idade{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:9px;color:var(--ink3);letter-spacing:0.15em;margin-bottom:1rem}
.char-arquetipo{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;color:var(--ink2);margin-bottom:1.2rem;padding:0.5rem 0.8rem;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border-left:2px solid}
.char-gabriel .char-arquetipo{border-color:var(--blue)}
.char-helena .char-arquetipo{border-color:var(--green)}
.char-romualdo .char-arquetipo{border-color:var(--red)}
.char-desc{font-size:0.9rem;color:var(--ink2);line-height:1.8}

/* MERCADO */
.mercado-bg{background:var(--bg)}
.mercado-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;background:rgba(0,212,255,0.08);margin:2rem 0 3rem}
.mercado-item{background:var(--bg);padding:2rem 1.5rem}
.mercado-label{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:8px;color:var(--ink3);letter-spacing:0.15em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:0.6rem}
.mercado-value{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.05rem;color:var(--cyan)}
.mercado-quote{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.3rem;font-style:italic;color:var(--gold);border-left:3px solid var(--gold);padding-left:2rem;line-height:1.7;max-width:700px}

/* CONTATO */
.contato-bg{background:var(--bg2)}
.contato-inner{max-width:640px;margin:0 auto;text-align:center}
.contato-emails{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.5rem;margin:2.5rem 0}
.contato-email{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:300;color:var(--cyan);text-decoration:none;transition:color 0.2s}
.contato-email:hover{color:var(--pink)}
.contato-email.btd{color:var(--pink)}
.contato-links{display:flex;gap:1.5rem;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:2rem}
.contato-link{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;color:var(--ink3);text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;transition:color 0.2s;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}
.contato-link::before{content:'↗';color:var(--cyan)}
.contato-link:hover{color:var(--cyan)}

/* FOOTER */
footer{padding:2rem 4rem;border-top:1px solid rgba(155,77,255,0.1);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:1rem}
.footer-text{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:9px;color:var(--ink3);letter-spacing:0.1em}
.footer-text span{color:var(--purple)}

/* MOBILE */
@media(max-width:900px){
  nav{padding:1rem 1.5rem}
  .nav-links{display:none;flex-direction:column;position:fixed;top:60px;left:0;right:0;background:rgba(3,3,10,0.98);padding:2rem;gap:1.5rem;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(155,77,255,0.1)}
  .nav-links.open{display:flex}
  .nav-toggle{display:flex}
  section{padding:5rem 1.5rem}
  .hero{padding:7rem 1.5rem 4rem}
  .eixos-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
  .av-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .trilha-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .lit-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .chars-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .mercado-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
  footer{padding:1.5rem}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<nav>
  <a href="#topo" class="nav-logo">BTD Universe</a>
  <div class="nav-links" id="navLinks">
    <a href="#universo">Universo</a>
    <a href="#audiovisual">Audiovisual</a>
    <a href="#trilha">Trilha</a>
    <a href="#literatura">Literatura</a>
    <a href="#contato">Contato</a>
  </div>
  <button class="nav-toggle" id="navToggle"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button>
</nav>

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero" id="topo">
  <div class="hero-bg"></div>
  <div class="hero-grid"></div>
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <img src="btdlogo.png" alt="BTD Logo" class="hero-logo">
    <div class="hero-eyebrow">Universo Transmídia</div>
    <h1 class="hero-title">Breaking<br><em>Through Digital</em></h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">Propriedade Intelectual Registrada · Navoctoris · Lucian Lourenço</p>
    <p class="hero-desc">Um ecossistema narrativo onde música, literatura, audiovisual, pesquisa científica, HQ e games se encontram numa única visão criativa. Cada obra alimenta e é alimentada pelas outras.</p>
    <div class="hero-frentes">
      <span class="frente-tag mus">Música</span>
      <span class="frente-tag lit">Literatura</span>
      <span class="frente-tag av">Audiovisual</span>
      <span class="frente-tag pes">Pesquisa</span>
      <span class="frente-tag hq">HQ · Games</span>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-ctas">
      <a href="#universo" class="btn btn-cyan">Explorar Universo</a>
      <a href="#audiovisual" class="btn btn-pink">Projetos</a>
      <a href="#contato" class="btn btn-gold">Pitch & Contato</a>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-pi">© 2024–2026 Lucian Lourenço · PI Registrada · Navoctoris · Todos os direitos reservados</div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- UNIVERSO — EIXOS -->
<section id="universo" class="eixos-bg">
  <div class="s-eyebrow" style="color:var(--purple)">Ecossistema Criativo</div>
  <h2 style="color:var(--purple)">O Universo BTD</h2>
  <div class="divider" style="background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--purple),transparent)"></div>
  <p class="eixos-intro">
    BTD não foi planejado. Foi convocado.<br><br>
    De um aparente simples conto, nascido do luto e das perdas, surgiu <em>Born to Die</em>. E de Born to Die, como mundos que brotam de mundos, nasceu este universo.<br><br>
    Não há CEO aqui. Há um griô. Um artesão. Um demiurgo cujas conexões atravessam toda a sua trajetória — a ancestralidade, a memória, a dor transformada em narrativa.<br><br>
    O BTD cresceu de forma inevitável. Suas raízes estão em cada texto, cada perda, cada descoberta. E agora se expande como algo novo, atravessador, potente e único — um universo transmídia onde cada linguagem é um fio do mesmo tecido invisível.
  </p>
  <p class="eixos-intro" style="border-left-color:var(--cyan);margin-top:-2rem">
    <em>Born to Die</em>, <em>O Tecido Invisível do Nada</em> e <em>Zeus-Mor</em> são os pilares audiovisuais — mas o universo se expande por música original, literatura, pesquisa acadêmica, HQ, games e linguagem digital. Cada linguagem é uma entrada para o mesmo mundo.
  </p>
  <p class="eixos-intro" style="border-left-color:var(--pink);margin-top:-2rem">
    As conexões do universo BTD não foram planejadas — foram descobertas. Os roteiros carregam no seu DNA conceitos de neurociência, psicologia social e simbologias que emergem de anos de pesquisa acadêmica. Não como ilustração — como substância. A memória que um personagem perde é a mesma que os estudos científicos tentam mapear. O luto que move uma narrativa é o mesmo que a psicologia social nomeia. A dor que vira música é a mesma que o ensaio acadêmico analisa.<br><br>
    Este universo é disruptivo porque não separa o que nunca deveria ter sido separado: arte, ciência e experiência vivida. É simbiótico porque cada linguagem alimenta as outras. E é único porque nasceu assim — não como projeto, mas como existência. Uma obra que se fez muito antes de ter nome.
  </p>
  <div class="eixos-grid">
    <div class="eixo mus">
      <div class="eixo-icon">🎵</div>
      <div class="eixo-titulo">Música</div>
      <p class="eixo-desc">Sad Stink. 60+ faixas originais. Trilha diegética do universo — rock, jazz, blues, pop. Just Gone · Museu de Mentiras · e mais.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="eixo lit">
      <div class="eixo-icon">📖</div>
      <div class="eixo-titulo">Literatura</div>
      <p class="eixo-desc">O Fio Tênue (publicado), O Inventário das Ruínas Vivas (em revisão), Entre Algoritmos e Colonialidade (em construção). Escrita como resistência.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="eixo av">
